00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.580
(Courtney starts to chuckle)

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:25.300
[K] Go out there, and then come back around

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.300
(Courtney chuckles.)

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.080
*Success noise as Shayne laugh's at his own joke*

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:35.160
[Keith, realizing that Court laughed] Oh, we got her... (Courtney chuckles again)

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.200
[K] Oh, we got her, we're good...come on!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.320
(Courtney busts out in laughter)

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.380
[Papa Gus] Hey, listen Honey...

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.600
Your mom and I have been talking and I know

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.600
you're really bummed that Bradley Fischer didn't ask you to the dance

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:48.740
but...I always want you to know that you're always going to be our beautiful little girl

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:49.900
Okay, honey?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.640
*Success noise as everyone laughs*

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.920
[Gus, while everyone is still laughing] ALL OVER MY FLOOR!!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.900
(Laughter get louder)

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.140
[Courtney, confused af] Ahh? What the *bleep*?? Where are you?

00:10:59.140 --> 00:10:59.820
[C] Uuuhhhh

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.480
[Keith] Put some water in your mouth! 
(Courtney chokes)

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.740
[Keith as everyone laughs] I didn't even do anything!! It isn't even a bit, it's Shayne's turn!

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.740
[C] Where did his voice just come from?!

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:10.540
[Keith] Don't worry, just put it in your mouth... 
(Courtney chuckles nervously)

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.660
(Olivia and Keith become impatient as Court receives a call)

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:15.560
[K] Who's callin--Is that Shayne?

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.720
Tell us what he says...

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:17.500
(Courtney mumbles "hello")

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:20.300
(Mumbles "uh huh")

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:22.320
[C] uh huh..

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:26.860
mmm?

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:33.020
(Court spews out water as success noise dings)

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.540
[Court, while everyone laughs] I hate you...

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:44.380
[Shayne] YoU'rE My fAvOrIte PiZzA plaaaaacceee (everyone breaks into hysterics)

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:45.320
[Keith] Stop hitting him!!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.720
[Shayne] Ahh, what a callback...
[Courtney] Oh, my God...

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.360
[Shayne] Alright, well,  Gus Johnson is undefeated...

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:53.180
[Courtney] Yeah, WOW, you're the CHAMPION!!
[Shayne] Literally, literally

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:56.100
[S] The best at this game, makes us all look bad...

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.860
[Olivia] Yeah... I mean...
(Shayne and Keith start laughing)

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.760
[Gus] You guys look fantastic...

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.060
(Everyone "oh's" at the compliment.)
[Shayne] Stop!!

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:02.560
[S] Gus, where can people find you?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.220
[Gus] Find me on YouTube! Just look up "Gus Johnson"!

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:07.940
No, I'm not the 50-year-old ESPN sports caster!!

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.620
(People chuckle) I'm just a kid!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.820
[G] I look nothing like him...

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.300
[Keith] No...Not at all..
[Gus] I think, he's actually black too...

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.220
(The squad chuckles)
[G] And has glasses...

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.480
[Shayne] Thank you guys, hit that notification bell, subscribe...

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.480
[S] you know how this, just do stuff..
[Courtney] Tell us who you want on!

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.020
[Shayne] Uhh...Call your parents!

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:23.180
[Courtney] Tell them you're their--they're your favorite pizza place..

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.060
[S] Text your parents, tell them they're your favorite pizza place

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.900
And tweet that to me and show what they respond with!
[Court] send the (gibberish) reply!

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.300
[Olivia] Oh...That'd be amazing!!
(Squad agrees that this is a great idea)

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.580
[Shayne] Alright...Goodbye!
(Everyone yells their goodbyes)

